Add clean command for calculated properties

Add a clean/fix-up command that scans all tasks and repairs missing or stale automatically calculated properties, including references and referenced-by.

When recalculating, treat task bodies and queue index membership as authoritative. If calculated properties disagree with the body links or whether a task appears in a queue index, overwrite the properties rather than changing task content or queue state. Properties are primarily informational and should be repairable from canonical state.

Include tests for missing forward references, missing backlinks, stale backlinks, and ambiguous cases where properties conflict with body or queue state.